      "message": "Don\u0027t think that\u0027s better, you used JobStaus\u0027s tracking controller flags inside maybeStopTrackingJobLocked() and maybeStartTrackingJobLocked() to remove/add the comming JobStatus object into mTopStartedJobs arrayset, so I prefer using the flags too prepareForExecutionLocked() too for code simplicity, so people could understand the logic once they see it without second thought. \n\nOr with aosp/2212538, plus rewriting maybeStopTrackingJobLocked() like the following might be more **clean code**\n```java\n    @Override\n    public void maybeStopTrackingJobLocked(JobStatus taskStatus, JobStatus incomingJob, boolean forUpdate) {\n        if (taskStatus.hasPowerConstraint()) {\n            taskStatus.clearTrackingController(JobStatus.TRACKING_BATTERY);\n            mTrackedTasks.remove(taskStatus);\n            mTopStartedJobs.remove(taskStatus);\n        }\n    }\n```",
